 xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
Suggests: slurp
Description: screen share picker for Hyprland with window and monitor previews
 hyprland-preview-share-picker is a GTK4 window that xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
 opens when an application asks to share the screen. The window shows a live
 preview of every monitor and every open window, captured through Hyprland's
 toplevel export protocol, plus a region option, and prints the user's choice
 back to the portal. It replaces the portal's default picker, a plain list of
 names.
 .
 xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland runs the picker when its configuration file names
 the binary in custom_picker_binary. The Oaxaca desktop does so in its
 Hyprland configuration (Omarchy's config/hypr/xdph.conf), and styles the window
 with the current theme's hyprland-preview-share-picker.css.
 .
 The region option runs slurp by default (package slurp).
